{"id":"n71291-1-3","stage":3,"title":"아마도 · 许是","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71291-1-3-1","ko":"진짜 이렇게 하면 살이 빠진단 말이지?","zh":"真的这样做就能瘦下来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"진짜","meaning":"真的","explanation":"진짜：真的","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71539","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하면","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살이","meaning":"齿","explanation":"살：齿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66663","senseId":"5","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠진단","meaning":"掉，减轻，变瘦","explanation":"빠지다：掉，减轻，变瘦；ㄴ단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"10","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이지?","meaning":"意思","explanation":"말：意思；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71539","definition":"没有假装或虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["진짜"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"齿","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66663","definition":"梳子上的被分为细细的一根一根的东西。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"掉，减轻，变瘦","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"66637","definition":"肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示再次强调或确认。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d2ea3efd1bf4164f6e8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71291-1-3-2","ko":"텔레비전에서 본 거니까 아마도 그렇지 않을까?","zh":"我是从电视上看到的，大概是这样吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"텔레비전에서","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"텔레비전：电视，电视机；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"텔레비전","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27373","senseId":"1","lemma":"텔레비전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"본","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니까","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아마도","meaning":"许是，恐怕","explanation":"아마도：许是，恐怕","readings":[{"term":"아마도","audio":"/audio/596fa0691be281c15bd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71291","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않을까?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f5472a609d9fa7b0","term":"텔레비전","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3","entryId":"27373","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"596fa0691be281c1","term":"아마도","zh":"许是，恐怕","audio":"/audio/596fa0691be281c15bd7.mp3","entryId":"71291","definition":"(强调)也许。","pronunciation":["아마도"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5683a8ae4dec64014c2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.177,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71291","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7746,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的这样做就能瘦下来吗？","我是从电视上看到的，大概是这样吧？","我完全不知道她是怎么看我的。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["真的这样做就能瘦下来吗？","我是从电视上看到的，大概是这样吧？","我完全不知道她是怎么看我的。"],"answer":1}]}
